---
// 浏览量眼睛图标：替代 👁 emoji（emoji 会被屏幕阅读器读出且各平台渲染不一致）
interface Props {
  count: number;
}
const { count } = Astro.props;
---
<span aria-label={`${count} 次浏览`}>
  <svg
    width="14"
    height="14"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="2"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
    aria-hidden="true"
    style="vertical-align: -2px; margin-right: 3px;"
  >
    <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path>
    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
  </svg>{count}
</span>
